<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE -- Arkansas Finance Authority.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE -- Arkansas Finance Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>ARKANSAS DEVELOPMENT FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $60,000,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996 SERIES D &amp; H 1997 SERIES A &amp; B</p>
<p>Effective at 1:00 P.M. E.S.T., Thursday, February 13, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach, Inc.</p>
<p>Crews &amp; Associates, Inc.</p>
<p>Llama Company</p>
<p>Stephens Inc.</p>
